\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"3c4f0648-9f29-4826-962c-eaac24926b04"],

Cell["\<\
A. Shtyk, G. Goldstein and C. Chamon, Electrons at the monkey saddle: a \
multicritical Lifshitz point, Phys. Rev. B 95, 035137 (2017).\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"115ccb8a-5ad8-4f40-af07-591e5e645941"],

Cell["\<\
N. F. Q. Yuan, H. Isobe and L. Fu, Magic of high-order van Hove singularity, \
Nat. Commun. 10, 5769 (2019).\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"be846cf6-8dc4-4bea-a775-f0af578e92c2"],

